{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_05_end","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_05","title":"會飲圖","storyCode":"DT-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"be877b49b05d1ad5afc4cd3a90067d12d2e9b4d55bb4f6df64dfb9721b9575bc","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在山上和墨魎相處甚好的萊歐斯不僅找到了用牠們製作果汁、果醬和果酒的方法，甚至還藉此窺到了一絲有關畫卷真相的端倪。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟著法琳走進了那座山洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，我才知道，她的秘訣究竟是什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，她還告訴了我所謂的“生態”是什麼，在那一刻，我才第一次知道自己原來是那麼地缺乏實踐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是在那一天，我和法琳成了好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"人生得一知己，夫復何求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這位法琳妹妹，對你來說一定很重要吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她是我最好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你不應該去找她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你說過，她被炎龍吃掉了，但是，你們有辦法復活她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎龍……炎龍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會去的，到時候，我會把她帶來婆山鎮見一見你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，今天來得似乎有點頻繁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……該不會是萊歐斯那傢伙捅了什麼婁子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我能做的……也只有這麼多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯小哥，看來你的夥伴們，只能靠你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，瑪露希爾妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，明明鐘聲響了，但是，卻沒有墨魎來襲擊鎮子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯也沒有回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，喜歡吃杏子的話，那就跑起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊歐斯說著，把採來的一把杏子往遠處一丟，只見一群大大小小的獸形墨魎都朝著杏子跑去。\n看著牠們搶杏子的畫面，萊歐斯開心極了，他幾乎要把這群傢伙當成自己家裡養的狗了。\n對，簡直就和奴莎、亞諾特里德、波夫、福奇、抹布和木木一樣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"呆呆的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，你們也有！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"對於這種有點像樹懶的墨魎，萊歐斯當然不會選擇讓牠們爭搶。\n他已經摸清楚了這種墨魎的喜好，特地摘了一堆水果，堆在那裡讓牠們放肆地吃。\n牠們吃飽了就會躺下，背上的顏色也會變……\n看著牠們挺著圓滾滾的肚子還要奮力往嘴裡塞果子的樣子，萊歐斯很好奇，真的會有人不喜歡這群小傢伙嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我怎麼會忘了你們呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏龜一樣的墨魎可以說是萊歐斯現在最好奇的墨魎了，一開始，他還以為牠們是一大塊石頭，直到自己一屁股坐了上去。\n這種墨魎的個性和烏龜如出一轍，而最有趣的是，如果你讓牠們吃飽了，牠們背上的假山會流下泉水——!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處雷聲隆隆。\n墨魎們聽到雷聲，紛紛想要站起來。\n可是，牠們發現自己站不起來……原因很簡單——\n牠們吃得太飽了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來今年的收成會很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了你啊，先西老爺子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒有你，我看這收成至少得少一半！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也只是把自己知道的知識運用起來罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西，別種田了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯自從上次跑去鎮外找墨魎後，好幾天沒回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯？他喜歡研究，就讓他去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，最近墨魎都沒有來攻擊鎮子了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他會不會出事了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……反正我們要在這裡待很久，不妨再等一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對……我們不能在這裡待很久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要一起去打敗炎龍、救出法琳的啊，你忘了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，說到這裡，我們在這座鎮子裡待多久了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們又餓了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，真是群貪心的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，今天也少不了你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，今天我們要來做一件不一樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"呆呆的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎——嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡快的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那邊的山頂了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那裡放了許多你們最愛的果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是想吃的話，就要靠自己的力量去爭取！這是自然界的鐵則！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了的話，那麼，三、二、一——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著萊歐斯的話音落下，墨魎們爭先恐後地向著山頂方向跑了起來——除了烏龜形的墨魎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你這是想要讓我坐上去嗎？你願意馱著我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真聰明，知道與其和牠們搶，不如討好我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，都有份，都有份。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"山中無日月。\n萊歐斯已經明白，雷聲會引得墨魎們下山去攻擊鎮子。\n但這件事並不是絕對的，墨魎們的習性並不會因此被抹去。\n那麼，為什麼不讓墨魎們盡可能遠離鎮子呢？\n這就是他正在做的事，從山頂跑到山腳，可比從山腰跑下去遠多了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……嗝……這酒真不錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就說，服不服吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇爾查克！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？瑪露希爾，你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喝了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯已經不知道多久沒回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近墨魎們也幾乎不再進攻了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定是他做了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓他做去吧，我要喝酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，奇爾查克的狀況和我們之前完全一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他幾乎要把自己當成鎮子裡的一員了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奇爾查克，你還記得我們來到這座鎮子多久了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得我們的目的是救出法琳嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得你最討厭寶箱怪嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嘶，呃，我的頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也反應過來了嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇爾查克，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎，嘎？（所以你們都叫什麼？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"呆呆的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡快的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎嗚！萊歐斯！（原來如此，你們的名字分別是，阿咬、小躁，還有偷閒？我叫萊歐斯！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嘎，嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小躁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷閒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎唔嘎嗚嘎嘎！（嗯，我們當然是好朋友！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寒盡不知年。\n萊歐斯已經不在乎雷聲是否響起了。\n如今，他已經和這群墨魎成為好朋友，他們同吃同住，每天一起摘果子，一起在山林裡奔跑嬉戲。\n他甚至能聽懂牠們在說些什麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定萊歐斯在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道……但是，墨魎們應該就是從這個方向來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果萊歐斯一直在研究牠們的話，我猜他一定會在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果按你說的，自從他來了這裡以後，墨魎們的進攻就變得少了許多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，是他做了什麼事阻止了墨魎的攻擊……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我總覺得，他可能只是跑去和那些墨魎不知道玩什麼去了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……還是快點先找到他究竟在哪裡吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊歐斯跟牠們一起生活得越是久，越是理解這種名為“墨魎”的“生物”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……該回去告訴其他人這個事實了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們大概會很驚訝吧，畢竟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎哦！（跟我一起來吧，我要介紹一下我的幾個同伴給你們。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小躁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嘎嘎！（放心，他們都是好人，不會傷害你們的——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷閒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——嘎——（嗯，他們一定也會喜歡你的！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，我們來幫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在救夥伴心切的三人看來，極端詭異的一幕出現了。\n他們著急尋找的萊歐斯——\n此時正四肢著地，像是野生動物一樣趴在地上，用他們根本無法理解的語言和墨魎們交流著。\n他們感覺到，心裡有某種東西碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嘎嘎！（啊，你們來得剛好耶！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，不好意思，用牠們的語言久了，差點不會說人話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起，是我們打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你們別走啊，我有很重要的發現要告訴你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，我們就不打擾您在這裡享福了，我們會自己尋找離開的方法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要告訴你們的，就和離開的方法有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友們，開飯了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——！（快活地跑向各種水果）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這……你用這些水果馴服了墨魎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠怎麼變色了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是牠的特性，阿咬吃飽了會變色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠叫阿咬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那個小狗一樣的墨魎叫小躁，烏龜一樣的叫偷閒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你取的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們告訴我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎——嘔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，不僅是餵飽了，這隻吃太多都吐了！而且吐出來的顏色好鮮豔，有點噁心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？好熟悉的……酒香……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西，你在幹嘛！那可是魔物吐出來的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是果酒的味道，嗯……聞起來發酵得很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……吃起來味道也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要亂吃東西啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，你們聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子裡晃晃蕩蕩的聲音。這個裡面是酒，這個裡面像是果醬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再來看這個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠吃了果子之後背上的假山也開始有泉水流動了，嗯……這些滲出來的東西，唔哦，好清爽的口感，是果汁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這和離開這裡有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下你就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西，你有帶能裝果醬和飲料的容器嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有，最近每天要和鎮裡人喝酒，搞得我隨身帶了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我你們想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我你們要……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，不過這些果醬人吃的話還是要加一點糖調味才可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些果汁的話……雖然味道都很清爽，但是口感還是有點單調。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以像這樣，把適合搭配在一起的果汁混合起來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也加入一些糖調味，攪拌均勻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……最後用玻璃瓶盛起來，放上點水果點綴——好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都來吃看看吧，老夫改良後的墨魎果酒、果醬和果汁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_i6"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯~這果酒還真的是別有一番風味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是糖的攝入量肯定超標了，今天要多做一點事消耗掉才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不想和你們這些會吃嘔吐物的人說話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蜂蜜其實就是蜜蜂的嘔吐物喔，瑪露希爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔像背上的蔬菜也是由迷宮中人們的排泄物澆灌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我不聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，你怎麼了？從剛才開始你就一言不發的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我想說說我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我追著那隻長了痣的墨魎去了鎮子外面，卻發現牠們居然能停下攻擊然後開開心心地偷吃水果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔物會襲擊人類，雖然有的時候是出於天生的攻擊性……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是大部分時候還有更確切的原因，比如領地受到侵犯，或者因為一些事情被激怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是因為飢餓而襲擊鎮子，牠們進食的狀態也不會像現在這樣溫和。你看牠們，一副溫順親人的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小躁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎汪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還流了滿地的口水，濕答答的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，鎮裡人對於墨魎的習性毫不了解其實也非常奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們才來沒多久就發現了餵水果這個方法，但鎮民們和墨魎這麼頻繁地接觸，就算是不想做，最後也應該迫不得已地去瞭解並制定對策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是鎮裡人卻沒有這麼做，就好像這麼做沒有必要一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能他們試過了，但是沒學會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更奇怪了，他們既沒有搬離這個會被騷擾的、不適合生活的地方，也沒有學會我們使用的這種攻擊方式……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是怎麼在這裡一直生活下去的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們發現了嗎？墨魎們甚至沒有被我們找到一個“窩”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，牠們還會不斷地死而復生，就好像……這裡的一切都是“假的”一樣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐？你是什麼時候……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"願聞其詳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在我們來的地方，傳說是一個叫“狂亂魔法師”的傢伙，用自己龐大的魔力創造了迷宮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那座迷宮裡，存在著各式各樣的魔物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些魔物並不是孤立的，牠們會互相影響，有的互相捕食，有的互相利用，有的互相依賴共生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都平等地處於同一個生態圈中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論狂亂魔法師是個什麼樣的人，能做到這一點，我認為都是非常了不起的。而這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，能夠製造這樣一個栩栩如生的世界的人，一定也是個非常厲害的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吧唧著嘴流口水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想……那個人既然創造了這些墨魎，又為什麼沒有為牠們設計一套更加完整的生態系統？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們的窩長什麼樣？怎樣繁衍？不同樣貌的墨魎之間是怎麼交流的？又和這裡的人有怎樣的關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的非常好奇，但一直都沒有看到。那個人究竟為什麼要設計這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我還發現了這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠們藏起了一筐山楂，卻一直沒有吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……山楂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）山楂……嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……我都沒有發現呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，一點自言自語罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"只是……原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"你所在意的事物之間的勾連，彼此互證，你我皆為對方的鏡子，對你來說，這才是你理解的“真”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，為什麼老夫完全沒聽懂他們兩個人的對話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……嗯……雖然我也很想這樣說，但是總覺得又有點聽懂了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……噗哈哈哈，有意思，有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，天地萬物皆有其理，畫中亦有眾生百態，墨魎當然也該有其來處，有其去處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"既然墨魎只是無根浮萍，則破綻自現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"古往今來，不是沒有人因此發現此間不過畫中境，但是……如此篤定的發言倒是很久沒有聽過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這何嘗不是一種“看山還是山，看水還是水”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"說著，黎不知為何轉身，看向天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這也算是參破了此間之妙吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這幅畫怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原本畫的明明是山水，怎麼變成了這個樣子……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這腌臢墨團，這水漬，這紅紫斑駁……誰來過我的房間？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這次倒不是我那“好姐姐”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思，是荒野上的精怪的手筆嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！怎麼突然打這麼大的雷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，看來是真的生氣了呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？誰？誰生氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得，這麼多墨魎都被吸引過來了，還醉得歪七扭八，這副樣子也是第一次見呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐，你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看！天上掉下來了一個人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……不像是掉下來的，像是飛過來的……看起來有點生氣，是創造這裡的魔法師嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊，一定是萊歐斯口無遮攔惹怒了她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我也沒說什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，這只是有點特別的……送客之道，並不是要置你們於死地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"墨魎畢竟只是她的雜念，既然是雜念，她不願好好安置也算情有可原。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！你輕一點，牠們剛剛吃飽，不能這樣倒著提起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕快拿瓶子裝起來，不能浪費了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都給我——出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊、啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼拿著劍畫——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畫啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！我的屁股！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們怎麼……你們還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳……我在這，我沒事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡……能聞到海的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來到海邊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，但至少，我們應該是離開那裡了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，等等，我還沒來得及和牠們道別呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果還是靠萊歐斯對魔物的愛來解決的啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，瑪露希爾，你的嘴上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嘴上怎麼黑黑的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你其實最後還是沒忍住也吃了，對不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯？……不對啊，你們也是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗呸呸呸！這是什麼味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛剛這是吃了什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這幅畫是不能要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒覺得他們很有趣……你不嚐嚐嗎？還有這些山楂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嚐一口唄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不吃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
